privacyPolicy.rights_items:
see the personal data we hold about you and get a copy of it;
have incorrect data corrected – much of it you can update yourself in the member app;
have your data deleted when it is no longer needed or you withdraw your consent (records we must keep by law are kept for the time required);
restrict or object to processing based on legitimate interest;
receive the data you gave us in a common machine-readable format;
withdraw your consent at any time, for example to being shown publicly.
